    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "旧理科準備室……変な色に光っていました。\r\nタキオンさんの研究道具も……\n私のコレクションも……みんな……。",
            "enText": "Everything in the old science room we\nshare… is glowing a weird color.\nThat includes your research equipment…\nand everyone in my collection…",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -5179543844176620411,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "あそこはアナタだけの空間じゃない……。\r\n……気をつけてください……。",
            "enText": "You're not the only one who uses\nthat space… Please be careful…",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 8529963122162418515,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アグネスタキオン",
            "enName": "Agnes Tachyon",
            "jpText": "あれは実験の余波、不慮の事故というものさ。\r\n私としても本意ではなかったんだ。",
            "enText": "That is an unfortunate side effect of my\nlatest experiment, but I assure you it was\na complete accident. Even I was not\nexpecting that outcome.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 1092691180962046804,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アグネスタキオン",
            "enName": "Agnes Tachyon",
            "jpText": "効能上、1時間も経てば元に戻るから\r\n安心してくれていい。ただ――",
            "enText": "Everything will be back to normal within\nan hour, so there's no need to worry.\nHowever…",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -6275444728082579747,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "……何か……？",
            "enText": "…What?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 8217365322591592582,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アグネスタキオン",
            "enName": "Agnes Tachyon",
            "jpText": "実に興味深い実験結果が得られたからね。\r\n是非とも再度、検証実験をしたいのだが。",
            "enText": "I gained some very valuable insight from\nthat experiment. And thus, I would like\nto perform it again.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -4442488796847961646,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "……。",
            "enText": "…",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 164894780544945149,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アグネスタキオン",
            "enName": "Agnes Tachyon",
            "jpText": "そう目くじらを立てないでくれ。\r\n……仕方ない、検証実験はひとまず諦めよう。",
            "enText": "There's no need to look at me like that…\nOh, fine. I suppose I'll abandon the\nexperiment for now.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -15787456899235727,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アグネスタキオン",
            "enName": "Agnes Tachyon",
            "jpText": "お詫びと言ってはなんだが、君の好きな\r\nコーヒーを淹れてあげようじゃないか。",
            "enText": "As an apology, why don't I make you\na cup of your favorite drink?",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 2329515870285353399,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "コーヒー……紅茶派のアナタが……？",
            "enText": "A coffee… from you, a tea drinker?",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -5318147921938927268,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アグネスタキオン",
            "enName": "Agnes Tachyon",
            "jpText": "もちろんさ。香りはダージリン、アッサム、\r\nアールグレイ――どんなものがご所望かな？",
            "enText": "Why, of course. I have Darjeeling, Assam,\nand Earl Grey. Which can I get for you?",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": 499757571792210059,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "………………いりません。",
            "enText": "…None of them.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": 3973283444732699114,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1780170514,
    "humanTl": true
}